@@ -3,3 +3,20 @@
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+`createRentalService()` from `src/index.ts` creates an independent in-memory rental
+service. Add equipment with a unique nonempty ID, kind (`board` or `sail`), and
+nonnegative daily price in integer euro cents. `quote({ itemId, start, end })`
+returns the total; `book` also reserves the item and returns a booking ID.
+
+Periods use ISO-8601 midnight UTC strings (with `Z` or `+00:00`). The end is
+exclusive and must follow the start. Adjacent rentals are allowed; overlapping
+rentals for the same item are rejected. Quotes do not reserve equipment or check
+availability. Prices and totals must be safe integers. Data lasts only for the
+lifetime of the service instance.
+
+Cancellation is not implemented. When added, cancellation less than 24 hours
+before the start receives no refund; at least 24 hours before receives a full
+refund.
+
+Run `npm test` with Node.js 22.18 or later (native TypeScript type stripping).
